{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LGWFZT268T3Kjc3wKgHn6E","type":"tool_result","content":"/-- **The subset rule's covering**: if `o(d, S) ⊆ o(r, S)` and `r` is playable, a solution\nthrough `r` gives one through `d`. -/\ntheorem searchSol_cl_insert_of_newlyOpened_subset {k : ℕ} {S : Finset V} {d r : V}\n    (h : newlyOpened G S d ⊆ newlyOpened G S r) (hr : stepCost G S r ≤ k)\n    (hs : SearchSol G k (cl G (insert r S))) : SearchSol G k (cl G (insert d S)) := by\n  have hX := cl_insert_cl_insert_of_newlyOpened_subset h\n  by_cases hrX : r ∈ cl G (insert d S)\n  · rw [insert_eq_of_mem hrX, cl_cl] at hX\n    rwa [hX]\n  · refine SearchSol.step r hrX ?_ (by rw [hX]; exact hs)\n    refine le_trans (card_le_card ?_) hr\n    exact sdiff_subset_sdiff (le_of_eq (opened_insert_cl_insert_of_newlyOpened_subset h))\n      (subset_cl_insert S d)\n\n/-! ### Dominance is a strict order -/\n\n39:  invariant `|O(S) ∖ S| ≤ k` (`solvable_insert_iff_of_free`), and\n353:theorem solvable_insert_iff_of_free {k : ℕ} {S : Finset V} {c : V}\n364:theorem searchSol_cl_of_solvable {k : ℕ} :","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e16c045b-e24f-404f-85ea-2e2a6ff5bc85","uuid":"171ae04f-47d3-49be-b3d6-6465ce64252b","timestamp":"2026-10-01T00:15:11.428Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/-- **The subset rule's covering**: if `o(d, S) ⊆ o(r, S)` and `r` is playable, a solution\nthrough `r` gives one through `d`. -/\ntheorem searchSol_cl_insert_of_newlyOpened_subset {k : ℕ} {S : Finset V} {d r : V}\n    (h : newlyOpened G S d ⊆ newlyOpened G S r) (hr : stepCost G S r ≤ k)\n    (hs : SearchSol G k (cl G (insert r S))) : SearchSol G k (cl G (insert d S)) := by\n  have hX := cl_insert_cl_insert_of_newlyOpened_subset h\n  by_cases hrX : r ∈ cl G (insert d S)\n  · rw [insert_eq_of_mem hrX, cl_cl] at hX\n    rwa [hX]\n  · refine SearchSol.step r hrX ?_ (by rw [hX]; exact hs)\n    refine le_trans (card_le_card ?_) hr\n    exact sdiff_subset_sdiff (le